<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>DASH DIAMOND -      CONTROL</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:#0b0e14;color:#fff;font-family:monospace;padding:10px}
.header{text-align:center;border:3px solid #008DE4;padding:15px;background:linear-gradient(45deg,#0b0e14,#12233f);border-radius:12px}
.header h1{color:#008DE4}
.card{border:2px solid #1a2a4a;background:#131a2b;padding:15px;margin:12px 0;border-radius:12px}
.card.dash{border-color:#008DE4}
.stat{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:6px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1a2a4a}
.btn{width:100%;padding:14px;margin:6px 0;border:none;border-radius:10px;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}
.btn-dash{background:#008DE4;color:#fff}
.btn-cyan{background:#00D2FF;color:#000}
input{width:100%;padding:12px;background:#0b0e14;border:2px solid #008DE4;color:#fff;border-radius:8px;margin:6px 0}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
<h1>💎 DASH DIAMOND - DASH.      /h1>
<p>🤖 GLOBAL CONTROL.   - MACHINE MANAGES 🔒</p>
</div>
<div class="card dash">
<h2>🌍 GLOBAL MACHINE STATUS - CYCLE 1 🔒</h2>
<div class="stat"><span>Lock:</span><span style="color:red">LOCKED 3 YEARS</span></div>
<div class="stat"><span>Pool:</span><span>10M Mining + 10M Mathosia</span></div>
</div>
<div class="card dash">
<button class="btn btn-dash" onclick="alert('Mining 0.5 DASH LOCKED 3Y Sir ⛏️🔒💙')">⛏️ MINE DIAMOND</button>
<input type="password" id="code" placeholder="Secure Code">
<button class="btn btn-cyan" onclick="alert('Fingerprint + Code = Donations Sir 🌍❤️💙')">👆 WITHDRAW FOR DONATIONS</button>
</div>
</body>
</html>
